    "body": "References #1552 and #820.\n\nThe native source-answer path can reach the correct value and still omit its boundary. This adds learned Period/Stop potentials from the selected Source’s full endpoint and the actual emitted response-prefix H4 state. Factual joint-Copy occurrence routing, context and existing cue/prefix carriers remain frozen; all candidates and global token aliases remain. The matching endpoint-unary arm uses the same capacity.\n\nThe directed64 fit improves complete development replies89→92/128 and new fresh3→8/32, with no complete-answer losses. Native full128 CE0.2771607606→0.2412554844; unary89/128 and4/32. Complete development bank pairs8→9/32, but fresh pairs remain0/16. Three development and three fresh gains repair Period at correct completed Source endpoints; two fresh gains repair EOS. This is bounded completion evidence, not full-history retrieval or general chat.\n\nValidation at executed source8b55fec5 (final head differs only in four documentation files): focused integer4/library1/driver2 tests, release and touched-file formatting pass; cap-only driver2/release/fmt pass. Full128/1204 admission and saved native outputs execute on CPU-only Linux x86_64. Independent saved admission110746checks and outcome1496467checks pass; harness-author causal audit54917checks passes. Audits do not rerun native inference, encoder, autodiff, optimizer or BLAKE3. One new development and13 new fresh prefixes lack saved parent-read comparisons. Whole-workspace format failure in unrelated upstream relation_compiler is retained.\n\nBoth64-update fits exit0 (workers56.678/60.671s),48-thread cap/no GPU. Full164files450538751B returned exactSHA/set. Complete180min card charged once; pre-fit report-only512→640MiB extension declared after observed568MB projection, numerical conditions unchanged. Source/config/artifact/report/review identities, candidate regressions, source/alias/phase limits and next decision are recorded in the evidence and current-state documents.\n\nRetain directed64 as a completion donor/research parent and originalprefix64 recovery. Next investigate prospectively bounded native-accepted Q4 terminal refinement from measured residual margins; no unchanged Adam repeat or authored runtime gate. Shared-session files are untouched. This PR does not close the programme issues or qualify complete-path D11, energy, prose or reasoning.\n",
